    M is Hermitian: True

    For N-dimensional ``c`` and/or ``r``, the result is a batch of Toeplitz matrices:

    >>> c = jnp.array([[1, 2, 3], [4, 5, 6]])
    >>> jax.scipy.linalg.toeplitz(c)
    Array([[[1, 2, 3],
            [2, 1, 2],
            [3, 2, 1]],
    <BLANKLINE>
